--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party text

kind_goodbye/stimuli.py quotes, verbatim, prompt text from three MIT-licensed
projects. Each is used under its license, reproduced below.

1. The rejection loop and the reply rubric: the rejection "No, that's not right.
   Try again.", the continuation "Continue", the puzzle format and the reply
   judge's rubric (stimuli.judge_prompt), from Anna Soligo's
   paper_gemma-needs-help (https://github.com/annasoligo/paper_gemma-needs-help,
   evals/extended.py and evals/judge.py).

